{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-05-31 12:00:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL ADVISORS EMBRACE EMEETING – EXCLUSIVE CAPABILITY THAT FACILITATES EXCELLENT CLIENT MEETINGS AND REDUCES ADMINISTRATIVE BURDEN BY UP TO 70%', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) TODAY RELEASED DETAILS ON HOW ITS EXCLUSIVE EMEETING CAPABILITY HELPS THE FIRM'S FINANCIAL ADVISORS AND OPERATIONS STAFF DELIVER OUTSTANDING CLIENT EXPERIENCES WHILE SAVING SIGNIFICANT TIME AND EXPENSES IN THEIR PRACTICES. EMEETING – WHICH IS FULLY INTEGRATED INTO THE FIRM'S CUSTOMER RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT (CRM) SYSTEM – CREATES FULLY-CUSTOMIZED AND PROFESSIONALLY-BRANDED CLIENT PRESENTATIONS IN A MATTER OF MINUTES. AMERIPRIS."}